977
01:48:24,079 --> 01:48:25,680
40-50 bin şu var.

978
01:48:28,220 --> 01:48:29,340
Doğru saydım mı acaba?

979
01:48:30,420 --> 01:48:30,880
Evet hocam.

980
01:48:31,720 --> 01:48:32,619
Üç tane buldum.

981
01:48:32,899 --> 01:48:33,260
